# Nollie: the nose button (Q) held as K is let go pops off the nose rolling forward; J + right is a
# Nollie Heelflip, worth tricks.stance.nollie (1.15) of a heelflip's points.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
hold nose 84..90
tap flip+right 96
run 300
expect event pop{fakie=false,nose=true} within 91..91
expect event trickEnd{trick=Nollie Heelflip,points=115} within 120..160
expect event comboLanded{name=Nollie Heelflip,points=115} within 160..240
expect no event bail
